    gmeow:expectedSourceShape logic:OperationalGapCarriesProposalConstraintProceduralConstraintShape ;
    gmeow:conformanceRationale "A logic:OperationalCapabilityGap naming no blocked step, so an absent capability is reported as a general provisioning complaint rather than a concrete blockage a proposal could close — the silent-substitution failure inverted. MUST emit shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent for logic:OperationalGapCarriesProposalConstraint and NO other finding." .
